@inherits Custom.Hybrid.RazorTyped

<div @Kit.Toolbar.Default(MyItem)>
  <h1>
    Test app to verify that App Quality Tests
  </h1>
  <p>
    Test app to verify that all the tests work as expected.
    The way to use it is to create a file with a problem, and verify that it fails.
  </p>

